# Recipe of Lumen Setup (org.lumen.setup) on the RS30, read by tools/devices/assemble_app.py: the shared lumen-system
# module (the remote step's "other remote" opens Remotes & Accessories through it) plus the app, as the Z9X builds it
# (devices/horse_popular/app/Z9xSetup.layers). The module is closed: no file of apps/LumenSetup may shadow it.
app       Z9xSetup
module    lumen-system
# the Lumen 2.0 look (apps/core/lumen-ui: Palette, LumenTheme, Tokens, Motion) and the icon set (apps/core/lumen-icons,
# its R class named in apps/LumenSetup/R_EXTRA_PACKAGES)
module    lumen-ui
module    lumen-icons
# the one QR code of every Lumen app (apps/core/lumen-qr): Alice and the Google help page
module    lumen-qr
top       apps/LumenSetup
skip      build/ test/ tools/ *.apk CHANGES*.md README*.md SYNCED.txt .DS_Store BUILD_VERSION
